# COMPONENT

## Bok

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.bok

### DESCRIPTION

BoK terminology and CAR/SAR existence knowledge component.

### SERVICE

#### SemanticIntegrationFederation

- spi-direction :: requires
- spi-component-api :: org.simplemodeling.textus.semanticintegration.api.SemanticIntegrationFederationApi
- spi-multiplicity :: "*"
- spi-required :: true

### COMPONENTLET

#### public-bok-retrieval

#### bok-retrieval-admin

# COMPONENTLET

## public-bok-retrieval

- component :: Bok
- kind :: participant

### DESCRIPTION

Public read boundary for typed BoK knowledge.

# COMPONENTLET

## bok-retrieval-admin

- component :: Bok
- kind :: participant

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative boundary for replacing one source-owned BoK dataset.

# SERVICE

## BokRetrieval

### DESCRIPTION

Typed operations for BoK terminology and CAR/SAR existence knowledge. Detailed
component usage and compatibility guidance remains owned by textus-cbd-support.

### OPERATION

#### replaceKnowledgeSource

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReplaceKnowledgeSourceRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReplaceKnowledgeSourceResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Replace one source-owned BoK dataset. This administration operation is not MCP Ready.

#### searchTerms

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SearchTermsRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SearchTermsResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Search curated BoK terminology with attributable evidence.

#### explainTerm

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ExplainTermRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ExplainTermResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one curated BoK term or an explicit no-match state.

#### searchComponentReferences

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentReferenceSearchRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentReferenceSearchResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Search existence-only CAR and SAR references suitable for CBD handoff. Exact component identity matching uses kind and name; organization is retained as an optional namespace qualifier on returned references.

#### getComponentReference

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentReferenceLookupRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentReferenceLookupResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one exact existence-only CAR or SAR reference. When supplied, organization narrows the lookup to that component namespace; when omitted, the lookup spans namespaces and reports ambiguity instead of selecting one.

#### getKnowledgeMap

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetKnowledgeMapRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

GetKnowledgeMapResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return a bounded factual topology from selected complete BoK generations. This public read is not MCP Ready.

#### searchSemanticKnowledge

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticKnowledgeSearchRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticKnowledgeSearchResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Search attributable public semantic metadata with bounded lexical retrieval and optional secondary provider candidates.

#### getSemanticManifest

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticManifestRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticManifestResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one attributable public semantic manifest record.

#### getSemanticResource

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticResourceRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticResourceResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one attributable public semantic resource record.

#### getSemanticSection

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticSectionRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticSectionResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one attributable public semantic section record.

#### discoverSemanticKnowledge

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticKnowledgeDiscoveryRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

SemanticKnowledgeDiscoveryResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Discover bounded attributable public semantic metadata.

