## SemanticKnowledgeRecord

### DESCRIPTION

Public value-only semantic metadata. Source contents, directives, skill bodies, and execution or mutation authority are excluded.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| kind | string | 1 |
| identity | string | 1 |
| title | string | 1 |
| summary | string | 1 |
| documentId | string | 1 |
| sectionId | string | ? |
| canonicalUrl | string | 1 |
| indexedAt | string | 1 |
| visibility | string | 1 |
| authority | string | 1 |
| sourceId | string | 1 |
| datasetId | string | 1 |
| generation | string | 1 |
| digest | string | 1 |
| stale | boolean | 1 |
| componentReference | ComponentReference | ? |
| evidence | BokEvidence | 1 |

